  translation {
    text: "Affected eastbound trips:\r\n7:01 am from W 63rd Ave & Wright St\r\n\nAffected westbound trips:\r\n8:47 am from Alameda Station Gate B\r\n\nAffected stops:\r\nBannock St & W 7th Ave (#12327) (eastbound)\r\nBannock St & W 5th Ave (#12326) (eastbound)\r\nBannock St & W 3rd Ave (#12324) (eastbound)\r\nW 1st Ave & Bannock St (#10398) (eastbound)\r\nCherokee St & W Irvington Pl (#12740) (eastbound)\r\nS Cherokee St & W Ellsworth Ave (#23209) (eastbound)\r\nS Cherokee St & W Bayaud Ave (#23210) (eastbound)\r\nS Cherokee St & W Cedar Ave (#23249) (eastbound)\r\nAlameda Station Gate B (#26256) (eastbound)\r\nAlameda Station Gate B (#26256) (westbound)\r\nS Bannock St & W Dakota Ave (#34672) (westbound)\r\nS Cherokee St & W Byers Pl (#23250) (westbound)\r\nS Cherokee St & W Bayaud Ave (#23212) (westbound)\r\nS Cherokee St & W Ellsworth Ave (#23213) (westbound)\r\nCherokee St & W Irvington Pl (#12744) (westbound)\r\nW 1st Ave & Bannock St (#10399) (westbound)\r\nBannock St & W 3rd Ave (#12323) (westbound)\r\nBannock St & W 5th Ave (#12325) (westbound)\r\nBannock St. & 7th Ave (#12331) (westbound)\r\nBannock St & W 9th Ave (#12328) (westbound)\r\nBannock St & W 11th Ave (#12318) (westbound)\r\nCherokee St & W 13th Ave (#12738) (westbound)\r\nCherokee St & W 14th Ave (#12739) (westbound)\r\nCourt Pl & 14th St (#17745) (westbound)\r\n15th St & Welton St [ Z Stop ] (#17701) (westbound)\r\n15th St & Champa St [ Z Stop ] (#17704) (westbound)\r\nLawrence St & 16th Street (#17752) (westbound)"
